npc N-GA-S2 34 16 W look=M1-S3-HR02-H1-T05-1-PF12-HD02-EY00 cond="PD_R01_6 >= 10 and GAME_HOUR >= 6 and GAME_HOUR < 18 and GA_BOX != 3" bark="인력들 입힐 거야. 맞는 치수로."
